{"ordinal":11967,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453788999683","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Death_05000f5","source":"Jacob: Всегда знал, что помру от чьей-то тупости.","target":"Jacob: Am știut mereu că o să mor din prostia cuiva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11968,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453788999682","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Death_024124b","source":"Jacob: Я думал, ты умнее…","target":"Jacob: Te credeam mai deștept…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11969,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453788999681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Death_0eba2a8","source":"Jacob: Сука...","target":"Jacob: Futu-i…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11970,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453788999680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Ears_DontShoot_041629f","source":"Jacob: Уверен, на этих говнюков ты потратишь больше боезапаса, чем на Гостей.","target":"Jacob: Sunt sigur că pe nemernicii ăștia o să cheltuiești mai multă muniție decât pe Musafiri.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11971,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805385","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Ears_DontShoot_0691cb5","source":"Jacob: Побереги патроны.","target":"Jacob: Păstrează-ți cartușele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11972,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805384","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Ears_DontShoot_01c4219","source":"Jacob: А сразу ведут себя как мудаки.","target":"Jacob: Și din prima se poartă ca niște dobitoci.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11973,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805383","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Ears_DontShoot_0cefc9a","source":"Jacob: Они, в отличие от Гостей, людьми не притворяются…","target":"Jacob: Ei, spre deosebire de Musafiri, nici nu pretind că sunt oameni…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11974,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805382","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Ears_DontShoot_0bcb160","source":"Jacob: Я надеюсь, что в КЧС-ников ты так же стволом тычешь.","target":"Jacob: Sper că și spre cei de la Comitet îndrepți pușca la fel.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11975,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805381","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Photo_DontShoot_082a4fb","source":"Jacob: То шея твоя останется целой.","target":"Jacob: Atunci gâtul tău va rămâne întreg.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11976,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805380","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Photo_DontShoot_0b69bb5","source":"Jacob: Но если будешь вести себя уважительно…","target":"Jacob: Dar dacă te porți cu respect…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11977,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805379","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Photo_DontShoot_00a4c63","source":"Jacob: Иначе тебе же хуже будет.","target":"Jacob: Altfel o să fie mai rău pentru tine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11978,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805378","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Photo_DontShoot_012d33b","source":"Jacob: Лучше больше не наставляй пушку на меня.","target":"Jacob: Mai bine nu mai îndrepta pușca spre mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11979,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805377","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Armpit_DontShoot_0741545","source":"Jacob: Пусть приходят, я им дам попробовать свои на вкус.","target":"Jacob: Să vină, le dau să le guste pe ale mele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11980,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453784805376","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Armpit_DontShoot_091facc","source":"Jacob: Может, они там ещё яйца Гостям лижут, чтобы новые признаки выявить?","target":"Jacob: Poate le ling și coaiele Musafirilor ca să descopere semne noi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11981,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611082","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Armpit_DontShoot_030ea8f","source":"Jacob: В КЧС совсем ёбу дали.","target":"Jacob: Ăștia de la Comitet au luat-o complet razna.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11982,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611081","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Armpit_DontShoot_0769bf2","source":"Jacob: Тоже мне признак. Подмышки.","target":"Jacob: Mare semn, ce să zic. Axilele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11983,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611080","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Eyes_DontShoot_043a2b2","source":"Jacob: Я не мог себе позволить даже глаз сомкнуть.","target":"Jacob: Nici măcar nu-mi permiteam să închid un ochi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11984,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611079","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Eyes_DontShoot_0cb7097","source":"Jacob: Днём прячась от солнца, а ночью от Гостей и КЧС-ников…","target":"Jacob: Ziua mă ascundeam de Soare, noaptea de Musafiri și de cei de la Comitet…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11985,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611078","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Eyes_DontShoot_019cbc8","source":"Jacob: Переться через полгорода…","target":"Jacob: Să străbat jumătate de oraș…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11986,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611077","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Eyes_DontShoot_03c09b2","source":"Jacob: Я бы посмотрел на твои глаза, если бы ты не спал несколько ночей.","target":"Jacob: Să-ți văd eu ochii după câteva nopți fără somn.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11987,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611076","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Hands_DontShoot_0a95e58","source":"Jacob: В нынешнее время сложно оставаться чистюлей.","target":"Jacob: În vremurile astea e greu să rămâi curat ca lacrima.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11988,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611075","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Hands_DontShoot_0292b7e","source":"Jacob: Телевизор поменьше смотри.","target":"Jacob: Uită-te mai puțin la televizor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11989,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611074","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Hands_DontShoot_0b20367","source":"Jacob: Любой бы руки запачкал.","target":"Jacob: Oricine și-ar fi murdărit mâinile.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11990,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611073","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Hands_DontShoot_0c44f73","source":"Jacob: На окраине в таком дерьме приходилось ковыряться.","target":"Jacob: La periferie a trebuit să scormonesc prin niște mizerii cumplite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11991,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453780611072","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Hands_DontShoot_0f9061b","source":"Jacob: Я понимаю, как это выглядит.","target":"Jacob: Înțeleg cum arată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
