{"ordinal":11993,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453776416777","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Teeth_DontShoot_00b9bed","source":"Jacob: То в следующий раз я их почищу…","target":"Jacob: Data viitoare o să mi-i curăț…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11994,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453776416776","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Jacob_Teeth_DontShoot_080609a","source":"Jacob: Если тебя так напрягают мои зубы…","target":"Jacob: Dacă te deranjează atât de tare dinții mei…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-303.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
